Title: Biker badly hurt in crash on rural road near Hawick
Date: 2025-07-14
Firsthand information: {'Speaker': [], 'Description': [{'Description': 'A biker is in hospital with serious injuries after a crash on a rural road in the Borders.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 1, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 71}}, {'Description': 'Emergency services were called to the single-vehicle crash on the B6399 near Hawick at about 12:00 on Sunday.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 2, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 101}}, {'Description': 'The accident happened just south of the access road to the Pines Burn wind farm and involved a white and blue Suzuki GSXR motorbike.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 3, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 111}}, {'Description': 'A 57-year-old man was taken to hospital for treatment to serious injuries and the road was shut for about eight hours. Police have appealed for witnesses.', 'Citation': {'Paragraph': 4, 'StartChar': 0, 'EndChar': 133}}], 'Image': [{'ID': 'image_1', 'Caption': 'A rural road in the Borders with grass, trees and hedges up either side'}]}
